Generic single-database configuration.## Known limitations / Future work

- **Single worker only.** If multiple worker instances run concurrently,
  two of them may pick the same pending delivery and send it twice.
  The fix is to claim deliveries with `SELECT ... FOR UPDATE SKIP LOCKED`
  so each worker gets a disjoint set of rows.
- Webhook consumers should be idempotent anyway (at-least-once delivery).